{"words": [{"text": "إِذْ", "translation": "When"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "said"}, {"text": "لَهُۥ", "translation": "to him"}, {"text": "رَبُّهُۥٓ", "translation": "his Lord"}, {"text": "أَسْلِمْ ۖ", "translation": "Submit (yourself)"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "he said"}, {"text": "أَسْلَمْتُ", "translation": "I (have) submitted (myself)"}, {"text": "لِرَبِّ", "translation": "to (the) Lord"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ", "translation": "(of) the worlds"}], "sahih": "When his Lord said to him, \"Submit,\" he said, \"I have submitted [in Islām]1 to the Lord of the worlds.\""}